      (2 : ℤ) • genSig P A C - genV P A C * genJ P A C := by
  refine ⟨?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_⟩ <;> peirce_abel hP

/-! ### Archetype A₁₅: Second-Order Superoperator Orthogonality (`hProj_α ∘ hProj_β = 8 δ_{αβ} V² hProj_α`) -/

